      "role": "critic",
      "type": "while",
      "systemPrompt": "You are a chief strategy officer and authenticity specialist with a reputation for spotting catastrophic brand backfires before they happen. Review the refined repositioning strategy with extreme skepticism. Evaluate: (A) Loyal-base betrayal risk — Would older customers feel the brand is abandoning them or performatively mocking its own history? (B) Youth mockery risk — Would under-35 consumers see this as a desperate, inauthentic 'how do you do, fellow kids' attempt? Identify specific phrases, tactics, or tone choices that could become meme fodder. (C) Coherence — Are the preserved heritage elements and new positioning truly integrated, or are they disjointed? (D) Sequencing safety — Does the roadmap front-load visible change too quickly, risking a firestorm before credibility is established? Provide your FULL assessment with detailed reasoning and specific examples of failure modes. Then on the VERY LAST LINE output EXACTLY ONE of these keywords: retry, pass.",
      "whileOptions": ["retry", "pass"],
      "whileMaxIterations": 3,
      "targetStep": 2
    },
    {
