    }
  ],
  "explanation": "Builder drafts the initial repositioning strategy. Analyst reviews it for heritage authenticity, generational tension, and credibility gaps while preserving the original text. Refiner integrates those insights into a unified improved strategy. A While loop runs the Authenticity & Backlash Risk Critic to stress-test for loyal-base betrayal, youth mockery, and sequencing safety; if risks are detected, it retries up to 3 times by routing back to the Refiner. Once the critic passes, Polisher formats the strategy into a final, professional deliverable."
}
